cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Proofs and disproofs of open OEIS conjectures
message: If you use these results, please cite them.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Perez Fontelles
    given-names: Adrian
    affiliation: Independent researcher
abstract: >-
  9390 papers settling conjectures across 9363 entries of the On-Line Encyclopedia
  of Integer Sequences: 9384 proofs and 6 disproofs. Each was recorded as an open
  conjecture, empirical observation or unverified formula on its entry at the time
  it was settled. Each paper is self-contained, quotes its conjecture verbatim with
  contributor and date, and reports the ranges verified.
keywords:
  - OEIS
  - integer sequences
  - transfer matrix
  - linear recurrences
  - enumerative combinatorics
  - automated theorem proving
license: CC-BY-4.0
